{% alert level="info" %}
The Datadog Java tracer interoperates with the `opentracing-api` library for custom instrumentation.
{% /alert %}

### Add custom span tags {% #add-custom-span-tags-java %}

Add custom tags to your spans corresponding to any dynamic value in your application code:

```java
import io.opentracing.Span;
import io.opentracing.util.GlobalTracer;

final Span span = GlobalTracer.get().activeSpan();
if (span != null) {
  span.setTag("customer.id", customerId);
}
```

A partial ends here.
